# Check everything out with LF line endings, on every platform.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone gets CRLF, and then `gofmt -l .` reports every Go
# file as unformatted and shell scripts fail inside the build container. Go itself
# tolerates CRLF; the tooling around it does not.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, if any are ever added.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
